19:27:11 [DEBUG] anthropic._base_client: Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-60eb9cf4-c073-466c-8823-5f74e968960e', 'content': None, 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Full-stack smoke test. I just dropped two files into chat — the first one\'s a stem from FL, the second one\'s a song I want as a sonic reference. (1) Confirm where each\n  ▎ landed via get_workspace_status. If the stem is in drops/ instead of stems/, walk me through the Move-menu fix in the sidebar. (2) Render the full project with\n  ▎ prepare_batch_render so we have current numbers — read me the Ctrl+R instruction verbatim before waiting. After the export, run compare_to_reference between the master\n  ▎ and the reference file. (3) Pick the single biggest spectral problem the comparison surfaces and propose a concrete fix using the right tool: set_proq3 if Pro-Q 3 is\n  ▎ loaded, set_builtin_eq otherwise. Snapshot, predict the spectral_balance delta, apply, re-render the affected track + master, and report before/after as a table. (4) Now\n  ▎ load Fruity Compressor on the drum bus if it\'s not already there, and use set_compressor to add gentle bus compression — threshold around -12 dB, ratio 2:1, attack 10 ms,\n  ▎  release 80 ms, +1 dB makeup. After it\'s set, right-click each Fruity Comp knob in FL → "edit value", read me the actual displayed values, and tell me which axes drift\n  ▎ more than 20% from what you intended. (5) Sidechain the bass to the kick: pre-load Fruity Compressor on bass, call apply_sidechain, read me the dropdown advisory\n  ▎ verbatim, and pause for me to confirm in FL. After I confirm, tune the bass comp\'s threshold/release for ~6 dB pump and re-render. (6) When everything\'s done,\n  ▎ write_history_entry summarising all four moves with their numeric deltas.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'text': "I'll work through each step methodically. Let me start with the orientation tools.", 'type': 'text'}, {'id': 'toolu_014N45srRswfbC87RBxRUYE6', 'caller': {'type': 'direct'}, 'input': {}, 'name': 'get_workspace_status', 'type': 'tool_use'}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_014N45srRswfbC87RBxRUYE6', 'content': '{"project_name": "koto", "root": "C:\\\\Users\\\\mpamp\\\\StudioMind\\\\projects\\\\koto", "fl_project_path": null, "stems_dir": "C:\\\\Users\\\\mpamp\\\\StudioMind\\\\projects\\\\koto\\\\stems", "masters_dir": "C:\\\\Users\\\\mpamp\\\\StudioMind\\\\projects\\\\koto\\\\masters", "references_dir": "C:\\\\Users\\\\mpamp\\\\StudioMind\\\\projects\\\\koto\\\\references", "drops_dir": "C:\\\\Users\\\\mpamp\\\\StudioMind\\\\projects\\\\koto\\\\drops", "stems": [{"kind": "stem", "filename": "koto_Omnisphere [64bit].wav", "status": "pending", "track_id": 1, "track_name": "Omnisphere [64bit]", "fl_state_hash": "868e09aa319ba6d8", "rendered_at": null, "analysis": null}, {"kind": "stem", "filename": "koto_[reese] bob cochonou.wav", "status": "pending", "track_id": 2, "track_name": "[reese] bob cochonou", "fl_state_hash": "4949a779894b6665", "rendered_at": null, "analysis": null}, {"kind": "stem", "filename": "koto_[808] choucroute.wav", "status": "pending", "track_id": 3, "track_name": "[808] choucroute", "fl_state_hash": "d6af0867ae197265", "rendered_at": null, "analysis": null}, {"kind": "stem", "filename": "koto_JP - Simmie Hat.wav", "status": "pending", "track_id": 4, "track_name": "JP - Simmie Hat", "fl_state_hash": "f07627c9ea9d184c", "rendered_at": null, "analysis": null}, {"kind": "stem", "filename": "koto_JP - Low Hat.wav", "status": "pending", "track_id": 5, "track_name": "JP - Low Hat", "fl_state_hash": "0ed881efbdf400db", "rendered_at": null, "analysis": null}, {"kind": "stem", "filename": "koto_JP - Crack Hat.wav", "status": "pending", "track_id": 6, "track_name": "JP - Crack Hat", "fl_state_hash":